# =============================================================================
# drøm (droem) — Official .gitignore (Phase 37 Clean Release Baseline)
# Note: .gitignore only controls which files Git tracks; it NEVER deletes files
# from your local disk.
# =============================================================================

# 1. Build Artifacts & Dependencies (Regenerable)
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
src-tauri/target/
target/
*.local

# 2. Debug Symbols, Binaries & Installer Outputs (Prevent accidental commit of local paths in PDB/EXE)
*.pdb
*.exe
*.msi
*.nsis
*.d
*.rlib
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# 3. Internal Review, Backup & Audit Documents (Do not include in public GitHub repository)
